 Child of the Last Flame)", "cards/commission-cards-06": "Commission: I want to know how hungry I once was. (The Child of the Last Flame)", "cards/commission-cards-07": "Commission: Among the things I did, was even one of them warm? (The Child of the Last Flame)", "cards/commission-cards-08": "Commission: In the end, what did I hold as I left? (The Child of the Last Flame)", "cards/commission-cards-09": "Commission: Tell me whom I gave my flowers to. (The Garland Girl)", "cards/commission-cards-10": "Commission: The song I used to sing, is it still there? (The Garland Girl)", "cards/commission-cards-11": "Commission: The brook beneath that willow, where was it? (The Garland Girl)", "cards/commission-cards-12": "Commission: Why did I come to hate him? (The Garland Girl)", "cards/commission-cards-13": "Commission: Of the flowers I wove, how many do you still remember? (The Garland Girl)", "cards/commission-cards-14": "Commission: The herbs my father taught me to know. (The Garland Girl)", "cards/commission-cards-15": "Commission: The most foolish thing I ever did. (The Garland Girl)", "cards/commission-cards-16": "Commission: I want to leave with a little peace. (The Garland Girl)", "cards/commission-cards-17": "Commission: Where was my last battle? (The King on the Barge)", "cards/commission-cards-18": "Commission: Did I forgive them? (The King on the Barge)", "cards/commission-cards-19": "Commission: How heavy was that crown? (The King on the Barge)", "cards/commission-cards-20": "Commission: Tell me who was ever true to me. (The King on the Barge)", "cards/commission-cards-21": "Commission: The sword I borrowed... (The King on the Barge)", "cards/commission-cards-22": "Commission: What did I ever hold? (The King on the Barge)", "cards/commission-cards-23": "Commission: What was I like when I was young? (The King on the Barge)", "cards/commission-cards-24": "Commission: In the end, did I let go? (The King on the Barge)", "cards/commission-cards-25": "Commission: Let me remember his face. (The Bride Who Stayed Below)", "cards/commission-cards-26": "Commission: Let me let go. (The Bride Who Stayed Below)", "cards/commission-cards-27": "Commission: Where were we married? (The Bride Who Stayed Below)", "cards/commission-cards-28": "Commission: That narrow, narrow stair. (The Bride Who Stayed Below)", "cards/commission-cards-29": "Commission: Am I angry with him? (The Bride Who Stayed Below)", "cards/commission-cards-30": "Commission: The last warmth of his hand. (The Bride Who Stayed Below)", "cards/commission-cards-31": "Commission: The road I walked behind him. (The Bride Who Stayed Below)", "cards/commission-cards-32": "Commission: Before the wedding, who was I? (The Bride Who Stayed Below)", "cards/commission-cards-33": "Commission: Whom did the soul once love? (Open Crossing)", "cards/commission-cards-34": "Commission: What could the soul not let go of, in the end? (Open Crossing)", "cards/commission-cards-35": "Commission: Where did the soul come from? (Open Crossing)", "cards/commission-cards-36": "Commission: What did the soul do that brought pride? (Open Crossing)", "cards/commission-cards-37": "Commission: What was the soul afraid of? (Open Crossing)", "cards/commission-cards-38": "Commission: Where did the soul once find peace? (Open Crossing)", "cards/commission-cards-39": "Commission: Did the soul ever regret anything? (Open Crossing)", "cards/commission-cards-40": "Commission: What does the soul carry across the river? (Open Crossing)"}}, {"id": "deck-soul", "kind": "deck", "type": "cards", "back": "cards/card-backs-standard-02.jpg", "fronts": ["cards/soul-cards-01.jpg", "cards/soul-cards-02.jpg", "cards/soul-cards-03.jpg", "cards/soul-cards-04.jpg", "cards/soul-cards-05.jpg"], "names": {"cards/soul-cards-01": "The Child of the Last Flame", "cards/soul-cards-02": "The Garland Girl", "cards/soul-cards-03": "The King on the Barge", "cards/soul-cards-04": "The Bride Who Stayed Below", "cards/soul-cards-05": "Open Crossi